{
	"title": "Calculer une intégrale à l'aide d'une primitive",
	"description": "∫ₐᵇ f(x) dx = F(b) − F(a) en valeur exacte : polynôme, eᵃˣ, a/x, u′/u, 2uu′ (pièges : F(a) − F(b), F(a) oublié)",
	"grades": ["T_SPE", "T_COMP"],
	"points": ["TCOMP-074", "TCOMP-076", "TCOMP-078", "TSPE-203", "TSPE-211"],
	"theme": "Intégration",
	"domain": "Calcul intégral",
	"subdomain": "Calcul par une primitive",
	"level": 2,
	"status": "draft",
	"delay": 60,
	"shared": {
		"cleanCoefficients": true,
		"blankDefaults": {
			"acceptDecimal": true
		}
	},
	"variations": [
		{
			"statement": "Soit $f$ la fonction définie sur $\\mathbb{R}$ par $f(x)={{m}}x{{p;+}}$.\n\nCalcule la valeur exacte de $\\displaystyle\\int_{{{a}}}^{{{b}}}f(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\n$?$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "a",
					"expression": "-3..1"
				},
				{
					"name": "b",
					"expression": "1..4"
				},
				{
					"name": "m",
					"expression": "1..6;±"
				},
				{
					"name": "p",
					"expression": "-5..5"
				}
			],
			"conditions": ["a < b", "m*(b^2-a^2)/2+p*(b-a) != 0"],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{eval:m*(b^2-a^2)/2+p*(b-a)}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"Une primitive de $f$ est $F$ définie par $F(x)={{eval:m/2}}x^2{{p;+}}x$.",
					"$\\displaystyle\\int_{{{a}}}^{{{b}}}f(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\big[F(x)\\big]_{ {{a}} }^{ {{b}} }=F({{b}})-F({{a}})={{eval:m*b^2/2+p*b}}-{{eval:m*a^2/2+p*a;()}}=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{eval:m*(b^2-a^2)/2+p*(b-a)}}}$."
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"statement": "Calcule la valeur exacte de $\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{1}e^{ {{a}}x}\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\n$?$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "a",
					"expression": "2..4;±"
				}
			],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{if:a>0|\\frac{e^{ {{a}} }-1}{ {{a}} }|\\frac{1-e^{ {{a}} }}{ {{eval:-a}} }}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"Une primitive de $x\\mapsto e^{ {{a}}x}$ est $F(x)={{eval:1/a}}e^{ {{a}}x}$ (forme $\\dfrac{1}{a}e^{ax}$).",
					"$\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{1}e^{ {{a}}x}\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\big[F(x)\\big]_0^1=F(1)-F(0)={{eval:1/a}}e^{ {{a}} }{{eval:-1/a;+}}=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{if:a>0|\\dfrac{e^{ {{a}} }-1}{ {{a}} }|\\dfrac{1-e^{ {{a}} }}{ {{eval:-a}} }}}}$."
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"statement": "Calcule la valeur exacte de $\\displaystyle\\int_{1}^{{{n}}}\\dfrac{ {{a}} }{x}\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\n$?$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "a",
					"expression": "1..5"
				},
				{
					"name": "n",
					"expression": "2..7"
				}
			],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{if:a==1|\\ln({{n}})|{{a}}\\ln({{n}})}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"Sur $[1\\,;{{n}}]$, une primitive de $x\\mapsto\\dfrac{ {{a}} }{x}$ est $F(x)={{a}}ln(x)$.",
					"$\\displaystyle\\int_{1}^{{{n}}}\\dfrac{ {{a}} }{x}\\,\\mathrm{d}x=F({{n}})-F(1)=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{if:a==1|\\ln({{n}})|{{a}}\\ln({{n}})}}}$ (car $\\ln(1)=0$)."
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"statement": "Calcule la valeur exacte de $\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{1}\\dfrac{2x}{x^2+{{m}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\n$?$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "m",
					"expression": "1..6"
				}
			],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{if:m==1|\\ln(2)|\\ln({{eval:m+1}})-\\ln({{m}})}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"Avec $u(x)=x^2+{{m}}>0$ et $u'(x)=2x$, l'intégrande est $\\dfrac{u'}{u}$ : une primitive est $\\ln(x^2+{{m}})$.",
					"$\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{1}\\dfrac{2x}{x^2+{{m}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\left[\\ln(x^2+{{m}})\\right]_0^1=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{if:m==1|\\ln(2)-\\ln(1)=\\ln(2)|\\ln({{eval:m+1}})-\\ln({{m}})}}}${{if:m==1|.|, soit $\\ln\\left(\\dfrac{ {{eval:m+1}} }{ {{m}} }\\right)$.}}"
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"statement": "Calcule la valeur exacte de $\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{1}4x(x^2+{{m}})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\n$?$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "m",
					"expression": "1..9"
				}
			],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{eval:2*m+1}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"Avec $u(x)=x^2+{{m}}$, $u'(x)=2x$ : $4x(x^2+{{m}})=2u'(x)u(x)$, dont une primitive est $u^2$, soit $(x^2+{{m}})^2$.",
					"$\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{1}4x(x^2+{{m}})\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\left[(x^2+{{m}})^2\\right]_0^1={{eval:(1+m)^2}}-{{eval:m^2}}=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{eval:2*m+1}}}$."
				]
			}
		}
	],
